{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576430/extras/SteamTheGame.png?t=1743454118\" /><br><br>Enter the world of Phrank's Photon Pharm and discover the wonders of Underland. Solve hundreds of puzzles as you work to to unmask the evil that threatens Underland's denizens. Use a wide variety of devices to manipulate the photons that are the lifeblood of Underland. Change the photon's color, direction, and even duplicate it to manipulate the world around you and save the day.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576430/extras/SteamTheWorld.png?t=1743454118\" /><br><br>Phrank\u2019s is set in Underland, a world of caverns beneath ours with a steampunk aesthetic. As you work to save Underland and its inhabitants you\u2019ll tour the farms around Underville, navigate the treacherous caves along the vital railway to Crystal City, uncover a mystery in the dark underbelly of Crystal City\u2019s industrial district, and discover the secrets hidden in the Shrouded Desert. During your adventures you\u2019ll meet a cast of characters including Phrank, his wife Phrannie, their children and many other denizens of Underland.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576430/extras/SteamSSBeam.png?t=1743454118\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pharm Hand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2576430/fc9d697f0391a26d767af7fe2f2305b0d835c752.jpg"},{"name":"Crop Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2576430/f2ecc30f06ce6b4234b5091c70ed87c2f3cdb755.jpg"},{"name":"River Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2576430/079c27fd604c71e08592b32e2894110f267d1781.jpg"},{"name":"Pharm Savior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu